<entry id="fileEdith" on="read" target="note.fileEdith" category="note" title="Bed four" once="run">
  @hale{code="0010" vo}: Mrs. E. Moss. Admitted 1961. Asks for the time at every round. Tell her it is not three.
</entry>

<entry id="fileWalter" on="read" target="note.fileWalter" category="note" title="Chair by the window" once="run">
  @hale{code="0010" vo}: Mr. W. Pell. Will not lie down. His wife's visits were stopped in '74; he has not asked since.
</entry>

<entry id="fileJune" on="read" target="note.fileJune" category="note" title="The cot" once="run">
  @hale{code="0010" vo}: Child, female, name unrecorded. Staff call her June after the month she came.
  @nell{code="0010" mono}: Unrecorded. They didn't even write her name down.
</entry>
